     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts CdaTSToDateTimeConceptMap</b></p><a name=\"CdaTSToDateTimeConceptMap\"> </a><a name=\"hcCdaTSToDateTimeConceptMap\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TS.html\">TS: PointInTime (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#instant\">instant</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TS.html#s-TS.value\">TS.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#instant#s-instant\">instant</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td>TS.value est converti en valeur FHIR instant (précision jour ou partielle : AAAA, AAAA-MM ou AAAA-MM-JJ).</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Groupe 2 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TS.html\">TS: PointInTime (V3 Data Type)</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/datatypes.html#dateTime\">dateTime</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/cda/stds/core/2.0.0-sd/StructureDefinition-TS.html#s-TS.value\">TS.value</a></td><td>0..1</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#r